# r1106cbp (rerun of r1106cbo) single boot: chain + ADD="CerbonsBetterBeacons-*.jar", group A (SQ-CBO-22)
## SQ-CBO-22 | chain + CerbonsBetterBeacons-*.jar
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
> cbo all
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect effects leaks 0$
reject \[cbo\] leak 
reject \[cbo\] leak .*echo_
expect mods loaded 1 of 24: better_beacons$
> cbo potions
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect potion creativecommon:long_reach registered: true
expect potion creativecommon:phantom_bane registered: true
> zq potion creativecommon:long_reach minecraft:redstone,minecraft:glowstone_dust
sleep 3
expect redstone -> .*long_long_reach
expect glowstone_dust -> .*strong_long_reach
shell ! grep -hE "mix skipped.*geode:" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log
